cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this driver in research, teaching or other work, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
title: "it8612-hwmon: Linux hwmon driver for the ITE IT8612E Super I/O"
abstract: >-
  A small read-only Linux kernel module that reads the temperatures and fan
  speeds of the ITE IT8612E Super I/O (chip ID 0x8612), which no Linux driver
  supports, through the standard hwmon interface.
authors:
  - name: ENERGYCODE
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
url: https://github.com/EnriquePH/it8612-hwmon
repository-code: https://github.com/EnriquePH/it8612-hwmon
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
keywords:
  - linux
  - hwmon
  - kernel-module
  - super-io
  - ite
  - it8612
